        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa muntu uutila bulowa bwamuntunyina, bulowa bwakwe alakwe buyootilwa kumaanza aamuntu, nkaambo muntu wakalengwa mucinkozya ca-Leza.",
          "type": "text",
